	(text "One board per door. Plugs into the BUS port (RJ12) of the operator (ProMatic/SupraMatic\nseries 4), emulates a UAP1-HCP module and exposes the door via HTTP/MQTT\n(firmware HCPBridgeMqtt by Gifford47, environment HCP_Giffordv2).\n\n  2 HCP bus and power\n  3 ESP32-S3\n\nWORK IN PROGRESS - rev 0.1 has not been manufactured or tested yet."
